text(await tools.apply_patch("*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: [PROJECT_WORKSPACE]/project/app/bilibili_live/tests/test_live_av.c\n@@\n   if(pass==2)assert(stats.resync>0&&stats.displayed>0);\n+  if(pass==2||pass==3||pass==5||pass==6)assert(stats.video_backlog_resync>0);\n*** Update File: [PROJECT_WORKSPACE]/project/app/bilibili_live/README.md\n@@\n 界面“音画”是视频相对播放时钟的差，“缓存”是压缩音频队列时长，\n “视频”是当前解码画面落后最新接收视频时间戳的时长；均不代表主播到屏幕的端到端延迟。\n+直播允许视频领先音频最多约 1 秒才开始同步等待，代替原先的 30 ms 门槛；\n+每帧等待仍限制在约 50 ms，取消时可退出。这个容差不是对实际音画差的硬保证。\n+“音画”负数表示视频领先，正数表示视频落后；日志 `sync_wait_ms` 统计累计同步等待。\n+累计 FPS 只用于诊断，不参与播放时钟。视频队列最老包的接收时间或时间戳跨度\n+超过 1 秒时进入关键帧恢复，仍保留参考帧依赖；不能保证在下一 IDR 到来前恢复新画面。\n*** Add File: [PROJECT_WORKSPACE]/output/sync-tolerance-1s/compare-sync-host.py\n+\"\"\"Compare former 30ms and new 1s sync waits using the same real decoders.\"\"\"\n+from pathlib import Path\n+import subprocess\n+\n+src = Path('/mnt/c/Users/11937/Documents/ChatGPT/vela/project/app/bilibili_live')\n+out = Path('/home/flash/vela-p4/out/latency-host')\n+work = Path('/mnt/c/Users/11937/Documents/ChatGPT/vela/output/sync-tolerance-1s')\n+flags = ['-g', '-O1', '-fsanitize=address,undefined', '-fno-omit-frame-pointer',\n+         '-pthread', '-DUSE_DEFAULT_STDLIB', '-I'+str(src),\n+         '-I'+str(src/'local_vendor'), '-I'+str(src/'local_vendor/helix')]\n+common = [p for p in out.glob('*.o') if not p.name.startswith(('bili_av-', 'test_live_av-'))]\n+for mode in ['former-30ms', 'new-1s']:\n+    av = (src/'bili_av.c').read_text()\n+    test = (src/'tests/test_live_av.c').read_text().replace('pass=0;pass<9', 'pass=7;pass<9')\n+    if mode == 'former-30ms':\n+        av = av.replace('#define VIDEO_SYNC_LEAD_MS 1000', '#define VIDEO_SYNC_LEAD_MS 30')\n+        test = test.replace('stats.sync_wait_us==0', 'stats.sync_wait_us>100000')\n+    objects = []\n+    for name, contents in [('av', av), ('test', test)]:\n+        source = work/(mode+'-'+name+'.c')\n+        obj = work/(mode+'-'+name+'.o')\n+        source.write_text(contents)\n+        subprocess.run(['cc', *flags, '-c', str(source), '-o', str(obj)], check=True)\n+        objects.append(obj)\n+    exe = work/mode\n+    subprocess.run(['g++', '-pthread', '-fsanitize=address,undefined',\n+                    *map(str, common+objects), '-lm', '-o', str(exe)], check=True)\n+    with (work/(mode+'.log')).open('w') as log:\n+        subprocess.run([str(exe), '/home/flash/vela-p4/out/media-host/live.flv'],\n+                       stdout=log, stderr=log, check=True, timeout=15)\n*** End Patch"));
